sequenceDiagram
  participant J as Joiner
  participant D as Descriptor or invite
  participant P as Pilot trust
  participant B as Bootstrap member
  participant S as Local store

  J->>D: verify founder signature
  J->>P: establish or reuse trust
  J->>B: roster_req over Pilot stream
  B-->>J: signed roster entries
  J->>S: apply roster after policy checks
  J->>B: profile and transport snapshots
  B-->>J: current member metadata
  J->>B: reconcile missing message ids
  B-->>J: signed message bodies
  J->>S: store verified group history
